              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Making your reporting life easier",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1b3435"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Over the past few months, a major focus for the BI team has been the delivery of the new Key Measures Report. This report brings together key impact measures for the organisation and provides a clear, high‑level view of how we’re tracking as a business. We’re really pleased to see strong uptake across the organisation, and it’s been great to hear how teams are already using it in their day‑to‑day work.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "14px"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "We’ve also seen many people reaching out through Pae Āwhina when they’ve run into questions or issues with the report. This feedback is incredibly valuable and helps us improve the experience for everyone, so please keep logging queries or getting in touch if something doesn’t look quite right.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "14px"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "You may have noticed that the design work we’ve been talking about is now live in the Key Measures Report. This report is the first to reflect our updated design approach, with clearer layouts and improved usability. Over the coming months, we’ll be rolling these changes out across our other reports as well.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "14px"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "We’ll be taking this step by step: first, we have removed the old branding from all reports, then we'll progressively introduce the new design elements. This approach allows us to make consistent improvements while minimising disruption and ensuring reports remain familiar and easy to use as the changes roll through.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "14px"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Report release highlights",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1b3435"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Waharoa Aged Debt Report",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#004a60"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "listType": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The Aged Debt report provides a consolidated view of tenancy‑level debt information sourced from Waharoa. It brings together aged debt figures across all Programmes and Sub-programmes, enabling users to monitor outstanding balances, identify trends, and understand debt positions at both a local and organisational level. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "14px"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Key Measure Report",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#004a60"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "listType": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The Key Measures Report brings together a range of key measures from across the organisation. It provides a single, consistent view of how we are performing against these measures, helping teams understand impact, track progress over time, and support informed decision‑making.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "14px"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Organisation Snapshot",
