                  }
                ],
                "listType": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The Organisation Snapshot Report provides an annual view of the organisation’s overall impact by bringing together key information about both staff and clients. It compares workforce and client data to give insight into who we serve and how we operate, including reporting on gender, ethnicity, age, and the volume of services delivered. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
