                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Timi has been working with numbers for 40 years and still loves the thrill of translating data into meaningful insights. She's an analyst by trade, and a lifelong logic enthusiast. Outside of work, she's happiest in the garden, knitting, sewing, or cooking for her wonderfully chaotic, extensive, whānau."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "People often ask her about her name—"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Timi",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontStyle": "italic"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " (pronounced Timmy) is an English twist of a Japanese Name - "
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Timiko ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontStyle": "italic"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "gifted to her by her Japanese mother."
                  }
